The error is only an empty shell variable. This is a new server (`lpw9`), so the `P` variable you set earlier doesn't exist in this shell. `--project=$P` became `--project=`, which gcloud rejects. Setting the default project didn't help, because the explicit empty flag overrides it. Define `P` again, and do it each time you land on a new server.

