## What each result means

| Command | Result | Meaning |
|---|---|---|
| 1. Key line, 12h | prints a timestamp | the key line was stored in that window, so the dev team must remove it |
| | prints nothing | not seen in 12 hours, but it may only appear on certain code paths |
| 2. New bucket | rows with `backend_…` and `frontend_…` | the sink works |
| | empty | wait 5 minutes, then check command 3 for the destination and the filter. If gcloud rejects the flags, use Logs Explorer → Refine scope → Log views and pick the new bucket |
| 3. `route-to-me2` | `filter` matches the `_Default` one exactly | no log type is missed |
| 4. `_Default` | `exclusions` list | shows whether the key-line exclusion is on `_Default` too |

## Things to confirm

